          "question": "Let $A = \\begin{bmatrix} 1 & -2 & -1 \\\\ 0 & 4 & -1 \\\\ -3 & 2 & 1 \\end{bmatrix}$, $B = \\begin{bmatrix} -2 \\\\ -5 \\\\ -7 \\end{bmatrix}$, $C = \\begin{bmatrix} 9 & 8 & 7 \\end{bmatrix}$. Which of the following is defined?",
